 * virtuals in xtb_native.h; the statements are the CUDA ones with cuda* -> hip*, cublasDsyrk -> rocblas_dsyrk,
 * the CUDA Impl buffers -> PbcState (xtb_hip_periodic_kernels.hiph) and the beginDispersion data -> the HIP Impl
